        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Carrie Coon, Ben Affleck, Rosamund Pike\n- Films: Gone Girl\n- Characters: Margo Dunne, Nick Dunne, Amy\n- Places: Missouri\n- Topics: Thriller films, mystery plots\n\nFacts:\n- In 2014, the thriller film \"Gone Girl\" featured Carrie Coon as Margo Dunne.\n- \"Gone Girl\" is set in Missouri.\n- \"Gone Girl\" begins as a mystery about the events surrounding Nick Dunne, played by Ben Affleck, after the sudden disappearance of his wife Amy, played by Rosamund Pike.\n- In \"Gone Girl,\" Nick Dunne becomes the primary suspect in Amy's disappearance.",
